cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these course materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Reproducible Workflows with Open Water Data: NASA, NOAA, USGS River Data Access"
abstract: >-
  Learning materials for a CUAHSI micro-credentialing course on building reproducible workflows that find,
  retrieve and combine federal open water data (NASA SWOT, the NOAA National Water Model and USGS Water Data for the Nation)
  with Python. Includes the course website (MyST Markdown lessons) and generated teaching materials
  (slides, readings, notebooks, quizzes and an instructor guide).
